<p>Greek authorities are investigating an unmanned naval drone found this week off the Ionian island of Lefkada. Defence Minister Nikos Dendias said the vessel came from a “foreign state”. The BBC reported that fishermen found the unmanned vessel in a cave on Thursday and that Greece carried out a controlled detonation of its explosives. The vessel is suspected to be of Ukrainian origin, according to the BBC, and a Greek military source cited by DW said it may have been Ukrainian. DW and The Straits Times reported that Ukraine has acknowledged using drones to target Russian oil tankers in the Mediterranean.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/b4a6pEE6mLDdBKELFcjjYY0RzgG99z2hsxciz4F69Wv8yX_5EfZ9DBXlkYb7cJCXGhbEdwcqKV3CGVkC5Ekw2g1IV_lkTm68ipustBa4O2PhI7LzSarrPe9svbZxOek_-sX-3M5QVVrOPfs4m2UE9j32dxnG2wKY' alt='Image published with coverage of the unmanned vessel found in Greece.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Explosives neutralized: Greek authorities carried out a controlled detonation of explosives from the unmanned vessel after its discovery near Lefkada.</li><li>Engine running: Local reports said the drone was carrying explosives and that its engine was still operating when fishermen found it.</li><li>Security agencies: MEGA reported that the drone was transferred to a naval base in Attica, where the armed forces and Greece’s National Intelligence Service were examining it.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Greek Defence Minister Nikos Dendias: Dendias said the drone came from a foreign state and that Greece was developing capabilities to produce advanced drones for its navy. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/greek-minister-says-mystery-drone-from-a-foreign-state/a-77107116'>DW</a>)</li><li>Greek military source: A Greek military source said the vessel may have been Ukrainian. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/greek-minister-says-mystery-drone-from-a-foreign-state/a-77107116'>DW</a>)</li><li>Local fishermen: A fisherman told MEGA he approached the vessel and helped move it before knowing it contained explosives, saying he would not have gone near it if he had known. (<a href='https://www.megatv.com/2026/05/09/leykada-synagermos-se-enoples-dynameis-kai-eyp-anazitoun-ta-mystika-tou-drone-kamikazi/'>MEGA TV</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/greek-minister-says-mystery-drone-from-a-foreign-state/a-77107116'>Greek minister says mystery drone from a &#x27;foreign state&#x27;</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/mystery-sea-drone-in-greece-is-from-foreign-state-minister'>Mystery sea drone in Greece is from ‘foreign state’: Minister</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c9364r4r902o'>Greece conducts controlled blast of mystery naval drone explosives</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.is.fi/ulkomaat/art-2000011997105.html'>Kreikkalaisesta luolasta löytyi mystinen meridrooni</a> - is.fi</li><li><a href='https://www.vizionplus.tv/sekuestrohet-ne-greqi-nje-anije-misterioze-me-drone-dhe-eksplozive-te-prodhuar-ne-ukraine-policia-nis-hetimet/'>Sekuestrohet në Greqi një anije misterioze me dronë dhe eksplozivë të prodhuar në Ukrainë, policia nis hetimet</a> - vizionplus.tv</li><li><a href='https://www.megatv.com/2026/05/09/leykada-synagermos-se-enoples-dynameis-kai-eyp-anazitoun-ta-mystika-tou-drone-kamikazi/'>Λευκάδα: Συναγερμός σε Ένοπλες Δυνάμεις και ΕΥΠ – Αναζητούν τα μυστικά του drone – καμικάζι</a> - megatv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.24ur.com/novice/tujina/na-lefkadi-se-je-pojavil-skrivnostni-morski-dron.html'>Na Lefkadi se je pojavil skrivnostni morski dron, poln eksploziva</a> - 24ur.com</li></ul>